<metadata><name>Clear Lake Butte from Skyline Sno-Park</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:166-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.174662" lon="-121.679190"><ele>1100.7</ele><name>Skyline Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:skyline-sno-park (OSM way 148323441); confidence: high; pdf_page: 163; book_elev_ft: 3640; quote: map 36: SKYLINE SNO-PARK 3640'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.163845" lon="-121.686998"><ele>1070.6</ele><name>Road 42 / Road 230 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 2489118775 on Road 42, 1.06 mi by road from the pin (0.2 past the Road 4290 junction, as map 36 has it); Road 230 itself is not in OSM or USFS; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 168; quote: a short uphill to Road 230 1.1 miles from the sno-park</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.164200" lon="-121.696500"><ele>1147.9</ele><name>Road 230 bend past the shelterwood</name><desc>source: placed from sketch map 36 (230 runs west past the shelterwood, then turns south); confidence: low; pdf_page: 168; quote: Ski the road to the far end of a shelterwood area on your right below the road and turn left</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.155011" lon="-121.696477"><ele>1157.5</ele><name>Road 230 / Road 240 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 2490784572 on Forest Road 240 (start of Forest Road 241), 0.6 mi west of Road 42 as on map 36; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 163; quote: map 36: 240 0.6 from Road 42 to the 230 crossing</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.156785" lon="-121.719243"><ele>1354.6</ele><name>Clear Lake Butte lookout</name><desc>source: OSM peak node 357308119; confidence: high; pdf_page: 168; book_elev_ft: 4458; quote: The summit of Clear Lake Butte (4,458 feet) has a fire lookout</desc></wpt>
